<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="TVM5.10.4">
<l>kaḷḷa vēṭattaik koṇṭupōyp purampukka vāṟuṅ kalantacurarai</l>
<l>yuḷḷam pētamcey tiṭṭuyi ruṇṭa vupāyaṅkaḷum</l>
<l>veḷḷa nīrccaṭai yāṉu niṉṉiṭai vēṟalāmai viḷaṅka niṉṟatu</l>
<l>muḷḷamuḷ kuṭainte ṉuyirai yurukki yuṇṇumē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>The way [he] entered the cities, going with a treacherous disguise, the means by which he mingled</l>
<l>with the Asuras, caused a division in [their] hearts [and] consumed [their] lives,</l>
<l>the one with water in a flood in [his] matted hair and [his] standing brightly inside you without being different,</l>
<l>[those] hollow out the inside of [my] heart, melt [and] consume my soul.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
